@startuml
title vbt-converter - Context Diagram (Level-0)

actor User

rectangle "convert_any_to_hdf5.py\nCLI driver"          as CLI1
rectangle "convert_hdf5_to_format.py\nCLI driver"      as CLI2

database  "Raw input directory / CSV\n(AMU or Basal-Ganglia)" as RAW_IN
folder    "Master HDF5 bundle\n.bundle.h5\n.raw_bundle.zip"                     as H5_ZIP_OUT
folder    "Protocol-specific artefacts\n(.npz, .dsr.npz, ...)" as PROTO_OUT

User --> CLI1 : invoke\nconvert_any_to_hdf5 ...
CLI1 --> RAW_IN : read
CLI1 --> H5_ZIP_OUT : write MasterBundle (HDF5) + Raw Bundle (ZIP)

User --> CLI2 : invoke\nconvert_hdf5_to_format ...
CLI2 --> H5_ZIP_OUT : read
CLI2 --> PROTO_OUT : write per-protocol files
@enduml